infra Plunder Pipeline — Full Simulation
slo-p90-latency-ms 2000

tag Team as t
  Platform teal default
  Bookings blue
  Ledger purple
  Search orange

Edge
  rps: 600
  -> CDN

CDN t: Platform
  description: CloudFront with AWS WAF for the crew-booking web app
  cache-hit: 40%
  firewall-block: 10%
  -> API Gateway

API Gateway t: Platform
  description: Per-tenant rate limits before the auth check
  ratelimit-rps: 2000
  latency-ms: 4
  -> Auth Service

Auth Service t: Platform
  description: Verifies session JWTs against Redis
  max-rps: 1500
  latency-ms: 12
  -/bookings-> [Booking Pods] split: 50%
  -/ledger-> [Ledger Pods] split: 30%
  -/search-> Search API split: 20%

[Booking Pods]
  instances: 2-4

  Crew Booking API t: Bookings
    description: Books crew onto voyages and records each treasure share
    max-rps: 100
    latency-ms: 60
    cb-error-threshold: 50%
    -> Bookings Postgres
    ~share.owed~> Kafka
    ~contract.pdf~> S3 Contracts

[Ledger Pods] collapsed
  instances: 2

  Ledger API t: Ledger
    max-rps: 300
    latency-ms: 40
    -> Ledger Replica

  Ledger Replica t: Ledger
    max-rps: 1200
    latency-ms: 6

Bookings Postgres t: Bookings
  max-rps: 2000
  latency-ms: 8
  uptime: 99.99%

Kafka t: Ledger
  buffer: 5000
  drain-rate: 150
  retention-hours: 72
  partitions: 6
  -> Payout Worker

Payout Worker t: Ledger
  description: Lambda that pays each crew member's treasure share
  concurrency: 60
  duration-ms: 300
  cold-start-ms: 900

S3 Contracts t: Bookings
  description: Signed voyage articles, one PDF per booking
  latency-ms: 30
  uptime: 99.99%

Search API t: Search
  max-rps: 300
  latency-ms: 90
  -> OpenSearch fanout: 4

OpenSearch t: Search
  description: Four shards of voyage listings by port
  max-rps: 4000
  latency-ms: 5
